{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             ﻿\n \n \n こんばんは〜\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZMG5VKBQYMNPR5D3BSXDVR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZMG6WZJNWCE5Y1FHNBB35A","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n ギリギリ2月だったので、\n 昨日のローソンオンラインイベントでは\n ツインテールしました\n (いま適当そうな理由つけた、笑)\n \n \n \n \n \n 10人で5チームに分かれて、\n ローソンさんやメンバーにまつわるクイズに答えて戦いました〜！\n \n \n みてくださった皆様。\n ありがとうございました〜☺︎\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZMG7XWJCYYXD3BG0AFMF8B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZMG918DC731ZXM26KDTWPD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZMGA6Y2CV1VD4P7N8FH7HS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n チーム『あおいのり』\n \n \n 私たち16点だったらしいです〜（ ;  ; ）\n たぶん最下位です、、、！🙄🙄\n \n \n \n \n 優勝した、\n 莉菜ちゃんとゆいちゃんチームのローソン店内ラジオ、始まったら聞きに行かないと〜！\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZMGBDCH8FYE2Y2WDBP5MAB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZMGCHPSA37QGPW038CES42","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 日向ぼっこするあかねん\n \n \n \n \n \n \n またね〜\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0H8CH1ZWZWFRPXM2DPQ8ZF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n L。\n \n \n \n \n あおい             "}],"source":"archive"}